 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** Depends on the number of iterations and the cost of computing the gradient (forward/backward pass in volume rendering). Adam adds constant overhead for maintaining moments.
-- **Memory Complexity:** $O(N)$ for parameters and gradients. Adam adds $O(N)$ for $m_t$ and $v_t$. Matrix-free implementation avoids storing the Hessian or normal equations ($O(N^2)$ or more).
